#: ../../../prop_rule/COMMAND_INDEX.rst:2
msgid "COMMAND_<INDEX>"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../prop_rule/COMMAND_INDEX.rst:6
msgid ""
"Read-only property giving a :ref:`semicolon-separated list <CMake Language "
"Lists>` of the arguments of the rule  as specified by the ``<INDEX>``th "
"``COMMAND`` option of the :command:`add_custom_rule` command. The index "
"range is starting at ``0``. If the index specified is out of the range of "
"commands, ``NOTFOUND`` is returned."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../prop_rule/COMMAND_INDEX.rst:12
msgid ""
"The :prop_rule:`COMMAND` rule property can be used as a shorthand to the "
"``COMMAND_0`` rule property."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../prop_rule/COMMAND_INDEX.rst:15
msgid ""
"The number of commands can be retrieve using the :prop_rule:`COMMAND_COUNT` "
"rule property."
msgstr ""
